{"id":"nzbqc7yqhgvv3im1pjvlvd4hx","title":"惠誉评级：中资银行业净息差预计温和回升","originalTitle":null,"summary":"惠誉将中资银行评级从‘bbb-’上调至‘bbb’，预计净息差温和回升。主要依据包括监管持续完善、信贷纪律加强及影子银行风险下降，负债端改善（政策利率平稳、存款重定价降低负债成本）超过贷款收益率下行压力。","reason":"原文给出了政策环境、信贷纪律和影子银行风险的变化，以及负债端改善超过贷款收益下行的压力，读者可据此分析银行业盈利能力变化。","source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15347898.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:54:54.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T12:22:11.784Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T12:22:11.784Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告","政策发布"],"score":83,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"30267133-09f8-4e25-b2d3-4e7ae7f4c6bc","title":"惠誉上调六家中资国有银行生存力评级至bbb"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面快报)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"30267133-09f8-4e25-b2d3-4e7ae7f4c6bc","title":"惠誉上调六家中资国有银行生存力评级至bbb"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"figeRPLKXsFw","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}